# r1106cba Boot 1: chain jars, group A superflat, fresh config (SQ-CBA-01 to -10).
## SQ-CBA-01 | chain boot: Creative Brewing loads with both members
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject NOT loaded:|is loaded from .*not from the Creative Brewing jar|Missing or unsupported mandatory|Encountered an unexpected exception|Exception in thread
## SQ-CBA-02 | no mixin failure, no client class on the dedicated server
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Attempted to load class net/minecraft/client
## SQ-CBA-03 | startup script order and script errors
shell grep -q "\[jar-startup\] startup script packs in order: .*creativedelight.*creativebrewing" logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell grep -q "\[creativebrewing\] core finished, members: vinery, brewinandchewin" logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined|global.trades missing" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
shell grep -E "Skipped creativebrewing:kubejs/|Loaded script creativebrewing:kubejs/" logs/kubejs/server.log | sed 's/.*\] //'
kjsexpect Skipped creativebrewing:kubejs/alexsmobs/lava_vision.js: Mod alexsmobs is not loaded
kjsexpect Loaded script creativebrewing:kubejs/vinery/wandering_trades.js
## SQ-CBA-04 | creativebrewing-common.toml tables and members
shell grep -nE "^\[(members|alcohol|effects|magic_resistance|copper_poisoning)\]|^\s*(vinery|brewinandchewin) = " config/creativebrewing-common.toml
shell test "$(grep -cE '^\[(members|alcohol|effects|magic_resistance|copper_poisoning)\]' config/creativebrewing-common.toml)" = 5
shell grep -qE "^\s*vinery = true" config/creativebrewing-common.toml && grep -qE "^\s*brewinandchewin = true" config/creativebrewing-common.toml
bootreject still has sections that moved to
