## SQ-CBA-07 | Magic Resistance reduces instant damage and negates Poison I
# a level with no player and no forced chunk stops ticking entities after 300 ticks: forceload the golems' chunk
> forceload add 0 0
sleep 2
> summon minecraft:iron_golem 0 -60 5 {Tags:["cbaA"],NoAI:1b}
> summon minecraft:iron_golem 3 -60 5 {Tags:["cbaB"],NoAI:1b}
> effect give @e[tag=cbaA] creativebrewing:magic_resistance 120 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbaA] minecraft:instant_damage 1 0
> effect give @e[tag=cbaB] minecraft:instant_damage 1 0
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[tag=cbaA,limit=1] Health
> data get entity @e[tag=cbaB,limit=1] Health
> effect give @e[tag=cbaA] minecraft:poison 10 0
sleep 5
> data get entity @e[tag=cbaA,limit=1] Health
> kill @e[tag=cbaA]
> kill @e[tag=cbaB]
> forceload remove 0 0
expect Applied effect Magic Resistance
